# ==========================================
# SolidWorks 专属 Git 忽略规则 (.gitignore)
# ==========================================

# === SolidWorks 运行时临时锁定文件（以 ~$ 开头）===
~$*.*
~$*.sldprt
~$*.sldasm
~$*.slddrw
~$*.SLDPRT
~$*.SLDASM
~$*.SLDDRW

# === 自动备份、临时保存与崩溃恢复文件 ===
*.bak
*.BAK
*.swb
*.SWB
*AutoRecover*
Backup of *.*
*.tmp
*.TMP

# === 仿真与有限元分析大文件缓存（Simulation / Flow Simulation / Motion）===
*.cwr
*.sim
*.smp
*.fld
*.r1*
*.r2*
*.r3*
*Results*/
*Simulation*/
*SolidWorks Flow Simulation*/

# === SolidWorks 导出过程临时文件、错误日志与注册表配置 ===
*.log
*.err
*.swp
*.sldreg
*.rpt

# === 操作系统与 IDE 本地配置文件 ===
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
